{"synopsis":"I-an dan Muyeol dikenal di kalangan teman-temannya sebagai pasangan yang penuh kasih sayang. Pada peringatan pernikahan ke-9 mereka, Muyeol memberi I-an sebuah gedung di Cheongdam-dong untuk memperluas galerinya. Mereka menghabiskan malam yang lebih penuh gairah dari biasanya, dan sepertinya itu adalah peringatan pernikahan yang sempurna… Hingga Muyeol diam-diam keluar untuk menemui selingkuhannya.","alternative_title":"나의 바람은 죄가 아니다","author":"Jinja","artist":"So Hwi","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"a3eccc99-cbeb-4d05-b9eb-caf1689e96bc","number":"57","chapter":"57","title":"","date":"2026-07-18","released":"2026-07-18"},{"chapter_id":"7f0a285f-2643-492f-a97c-47dae3899aea","number":"56","chapter":"56","title":"","date":"2026-07-10","released":"2026-07-10"},{"chapter_id":"728a73ff-f568-46e5-9d4a-f4a80fb5b9e3","number":"55","chapter":"55","title":"","date":"2026-07-10","released":"2026-07-10"},{"chapter_id":"c06457f1-1aea-48a6-8aeb-d1ac22eeb01a","number":"54","chapter":"54","title":"","date":"2026-07-02","released":"2026-07-02"},{"chapter_id":"2c274b43-353d-4b04-ab4b-8ef4ff1b321f","number":"53","chapter":"53","title":"","date":"2026-07-02","released":"2026-07-02"},{"chapter_id":"708f9998-e8ff-4d51-85ab-705253509f13","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"","date":"2026-07-02","released":"2026-07-02"},{"chapter_id":"997e7459-b3d6-4960-a621-95ea9e8fc350","number":"51","chapter":"51","title":"","date":"2026-07-02","released":"2026-07-02"},{"chapter_id":"5e45924d-ef1a-450f-a6f1-cfd6c3dbea51","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"","date":"2026-07-02","released":"2026-07-02"},{"chapter_id":"f377330f-f5d0-4c0d-959e-26d173fa798c","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"","date":"2026-07-02","released":"2026-07-02"},{"chapter_id":"1939f1ec-e147-42a9-9485-6810b8b9a290","number":"48","chapter":"48","title":"","date":"2026-05-13","released":"2026-05-13"},{"chapter_id":"a85ecc3e-40a3-4c46-9804-0ba1ede94797","number":"47","chapter":"47","title":"","date":"2026-05-13","release